    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const aliases = {\n  tsmc: ['tsmc', 'taiwan semiconductor'],\n};\nconst negativeKeywords = ['recipe', 'fruit', 'unboxing'];\n\nreturn $input.all().filter(item => {\n  const title = (item.json.title || '').toLowerCase();\n  const supplier = (item.json.supplier || '').toLowerCase();\n  const names = aliases[supplier] || (supplier ? [supplier] : []);\n\n  const matchesSupplier = names.length ? names.some(n => title.includes(n)) : true;\n  const hasNegative = negativeKeywords.some(neg => title.includes(neg));\n\n  return matchesSupplier && !hasNegative;\n});"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1600,
        -128
      ],
      "id": "dffd9b80-33b6-4f93-a014-36a94695cd03",
      "name": "Filter Irrelevant News"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a supply-chain risk analyst. Classify this headline about the supplier '{{ $json.supplier }}'.\n\nTitle: '{{ $json.title }}'\n\nRules:\n- Classify only what the headline explicitly states. Do not guess.\n- If the headline reports something that really happened or was officially announced and could disrupt the supplier or its supply chain, it is a real event. Use one of the event types below and a severity of 2 to 5.\n- Use \"not_relevant\" ONLY for opinion, analysis, questions, forecasts, product news or general business news with no concrete risk event.\n- Never use \"not_relevant\" if your own reason describes a real event.\n\nEvent types:\n- layoff, lawsuit, breach, bankruptcy, recall, leadership_change\n- disruption: natural disaster, fire, power outage, factory halt or shutdown, strike, sanctions, export ban\n- other: any other real event that doesn't fit above\n\nSeverity: 1 = no risk, 2 = minor, 3 = moderate, 4 = serious, 5 = critical (bankruptcy, major breach, plant shutdown)\n\nExamples:\nTitle: 'Supplier halts main factory after earthquake' -> {\"event_type\":\"disruption\",\"severity\":4,\"confidence\":0.9,\"reason\":\"Factory production stopped after a natural disaster.\"}\nTitle: 'Does buying a toolmaker reduce geographic risk?' -> {\"event_type\":\"not_relevant\",\"severity\":1,\"confidence\":0.9,\"reason\":\"Opinion question, no concrete event.\"}\n\nReturn only a raw JSON object with no extra text:\n{ \"event_type\": \"layoff\" | \"lawsuit\" | \"breach\" | \"bankruptcy\" | \"recall\" | \"leadership_change\" | \"disruption\" | \"other\" | \"not_relevant\", \"severity\": 1 to 5, \"confidence\": 0.0 to 1.0, \"reason\": \"one short sentence\" }",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        2000,
        -160
      ],
      "id": "f7168eaa-c747-49ce-a33d-790331a7a9b1",
      "name": "AI Agent"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "qwen2.5:1.5b",
        "options": {
          "think": false,
          "temperature": 0,
          "format": "json"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOllama",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2032,
        80
      ],
      "id": "0619a40d-53ee-4b50-acbe-591b6f04ebba",
      "name": "Ollama Chat Model",
      "credentials": {
        "ollamaApi": {
          "id": "hLEDe9zjlNI7RRXI",
          "name": "Ollama account 2"
        }
      }
